.Dd November 4, 2026
.Dt BSDDD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bsddd
.Nd experimental BSD desktop session compatibility daemon
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl Fl probe
.Nm
.Fl Fl foreground
.Sh DESCRIPTION
BSD cubed is a BSD-licensed desktop compatibility project for
.Fx .
This version supplies session discovery and controller lifetime
management through ConsoleKit2.
It does not yet enable a native GNOME Wayland login.
.Pp
The
.Fl Fl probe
option queries the existing ConsoleKit service without acquiring a bus name.
It requires neither root nor a desktop session.
.Pp
The
.Fl Fl foreground
option runs a partial
.Dq org.freedesktop.login1
service on the system bus.
It does not replace or queue behind an existing owner.
Bus policy must explicitly permit the caller to own that name.
No D-Bus policy or boot service is installed by this version.
.Pp
The service implements GetSession, GetSessionByPID, ListSessions,
and the read-only session properties Id, Active, Type, Class and State.
TakeControl requires the original D-Bus peer to own and belong to the session.
ReleaseControl is restricted to that controlling connection.
Each controller uses a separate backend connection, which is closed on client
disconnect, backend restart, release failure or daemon shutdown.
Forced takeover is unsupported.
.Pp
It does not implement session creation, seats, device access, inhibitors,
power management, notifications, or a user service manager.
Consumers must not interpret the presence of the bus name
as full logind support.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width DBUS_SYSTEM_BUS_ADDRESS
.It Ev DBUS_SYSTEM_BUS_ADDRESS
Overrides the system bus address as provided by GLib.
The tests direct this to a private bus; do not set it for privileged deployment.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error returns 64.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr daemon 8
